### 1. STUDENT GRADE API — POST

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/student-grade/
Content-Type: application/json

{
"name": "Althaf",
"mark1": 95,
"mark2": 90,
"mark3": 85
}

### 2. GET ALL STUDENTS — GET

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/student/

### 3. ADD A STUDENT — POST

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/student/
Content-Type: application/json

{
"name": "Althaf",
"age": 22,
"place": "Thiruvalla",
"email": "althafjalal@gmail.com",
"phone": "9876543210",
"course": "Computer Science"
}

### 4. GET ALL COURSES — GET

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/course/

### 5. ADD A COURSE — POST

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/course/
Content-Type: application/json

{
"course_name": "B.Tech Computer Science",
"university": "KTU",
"duration": "4 Years",
"department": "Computer Science and Engineering",
"semester": 8
}

### 6. GET ALL STUDENT MARKS — GET

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/marks/

### 7. ADD STUDENT MARKS — POST

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/marks/
Content-Type: application/json

{
"student_id": 1,
"name": "Althaf",
"python": 90,
"django": 85,
"database": 95
}
